"macOS protects system files, other users' data, Mail, Messages, Safari data, and Time Machine metadata behind Full Disk Access. Disk Map runs inside Continuum, so you grant this once to Continuum and every division shares it — there is no separate DiskScope permission. To index protected directories without access errors:" = "macOS 会将系统文件、其他用户的数据、Mail、Messages、Safari 数据以及 Time Machine 元数据置于完全磁盘访问权限保护之下。Disk Map 运行于 Continuum 内部，因此您只需为 Continuum 授权一次，所有分区即可共享此授权——不存在单独的 DiskScope 权限。要在不出现访问错误的情况下索引受保护目录：";
"Open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access." = "打开系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 完全磁盘访问权限。";
"Click the + button (authenticate if asked) and add Continuum, or enable its toggle if it is already listed. (Remove any stale duplicate entries.)" = "点击 + 按钮（如有提示请进行身份验证）并添加 Continuum，或者如果它已在列表中，则启用其开关。（请移除任何过期的重复条目。）";
"Quit and relaunch Continuum — access permissions are applied when the app starts." = "退出并重新启动 Continuum——访问权限会在应用启动时生效。";
"Disk Map only reads file names and sizes. It never opens file contents, writes nothing, and has no network access. Note: a small number of items owned by root may still be skipped even with Full Disk Access — FDA grants access to protected user data, not root privileges, so this is expected." = "Disk Map 只读取文件名和大小，绝不打开文件内容，不写入任何内容，也没有网络访问权限。注意：即使已获得完全磁盘访问权限，少量由 root 拥有的项目仍可能被跳过——FDA 授予的是对受保护用户数据的访问权限，而非 root 权限，因此这是正常现象。";
"%@ system-protected items were skipped (owned by root). Continuum has Full Disk Access — these aren't reachable by any app without root, so this is normal." = "已跳过 %@ 个受系统保护的项目（由 root 拥有）。Continuum 已获得完全磁盘访问权限——这些项目在没有 root 权限的情况下任何应用都无法访问，因此这是正常的。";
"%@ items could not be read. Grant Continuum Full Disk Access for a complete picture." = "有 %@ 个项目无法读取。请为 Continuum 授予完全磁盘访问权限以获取完整信息。";
"Showing all files. %@ root-locked items (red outline) can't be opened or modified without admin rights." = "正在显示所有文件。%@ 个受 root 锁定的项目（红色轮廓）在没有管理员权限的情况下无法打开或修改。";

